            "answer": "Staff directly tied to the designation requirements, such as the service manager and the full-time requirement, must have their securing status shown at the time of application. Recruitment, the design of working conditions and social-insurance application are the field of a certified social insurance and labour consultant, who contracts with you separately as an independent business."
